  "title": "Spiced Beef Stew",
  "description": "Beef stew meat is simmered with mixed vegetables in beef stock and beer in this hearty soup seasoned with thyme, bay leaf and brown sugar.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
